  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Task Force for Business and Stability Operations (TFBSO) Support (OCO-funded): Communications Support Services.</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">TFBSO Communications Support Services - Information technology (IT) support. Implementing Partner: International Business Machines Corp.. TFBSO supports the development of Afghanistans communications sector. Communications is one of the most successful industries in the nation. Afghanistan has increased mobile subscribers by 300 times since 2001, and facilitated $1.2 billion of investments in the telecommunications sector. Four major service providers cover over 75% of the Afghanistan population, including rural villages and urban populations alike.</narrative>
  </description>
